@testudo_umd brings the hype to every Terps game, tailgate or campus event. Now, UMD's beloved mascot has a new custom-made tuxedo, complete with a flashy red jacket, subtle diamond-patterned lining and state flag pocket square. 

It's one of several new outfits designed by @umd_arhu students, including a lab coat, artist's smock and winter gear. #ArtsforAll 

More on Testudo's new look at the link in our bio.
